{"format":"kards-original-reference","version":1,"id":"f41289b604e89c5c","name":"card_event_blitz_doctrine","package":"/Game/Blueprints/Cards/Germany/CovertOp/events/card_event_blitz_doctrine","parent":"UBaseCardObject","card":{"title":"BLITZ DOCTRINE","text":"Develop a German light tank. Add CONTEST DOCTRINE to your hand.","flavorText":"The Aufklärungsabteilung units of the German Wehrmacht, or reconnaissance battalions, were the eyes and ears of the advancing German forces and a vital part of the blitzkrieg doctrine.These units were equipped with armored cars, motorcycles, and sometimes light tanks, and they were tasked with scouting ahead of the main force to gather vital intelligence on enemy positions, troop movements, and terrain features. Their operations allowed the German command to make informed decisions in real-time and to adjust their strategies and exploit weaknesses in the enemy lines. The intelligence provided by these units were key to the Blitzkrieg's success, as it enabled the Germans to rapidly concentrate their forces at decisive points and to achieve breakthroughs in their attacks.","faction":"Germany","type":"order","rarity":"Rare","cost":2,"operationCost":0,"attack":0,"defense":0},"defaults":{"UberGraphFrame":{},"GameplayTags":["ability.develop"],"Name":"card_event_blitz_doctrine","title":{"Namespace":"card_germany","Key":"card_event_blitz_doctrine_title","SourceString":"BLITZ DOCTRINE","LocalizedString":"BLITZ DOCTRINE"},"Type":"ETypeEnum::order","faction":"EFactionEnum::Germany","kredits":2,"Text":{"Namespace":"card_germany","Key":"card_event_blitz_doctrine_text","SourceString":"Develop a German light tank. Add CONTEST DOCTRINE to your hand.","LocalizedString":"Develop a German light tank. Add CONTEST DOCTRINE to your hand."},"flavorText":{"Namespace":"card_germany","Key":"card_event_blitz_doctrine_history","SourceString":"The Aufklärungsabteilung units of the German Wehrmacht, or reconnaissance battalions, were the eyes and ears of the adv